1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,133
How many birds will

2
00:00:02,133 --> 00:00:03,565
come to our feeder?

3
00:00:03,815 --> 00:00:04,969
Let's count!

4
00:00:05,969 --> 00:00:09,001
Shh. Stand still like a snowman.

5
00:00:09,251 --> 00:00:10,451
Freeze!

6
00:00:14,351 --> 00:00:15,416
Here's Robin!

7
00:00:15,416 --> 00:00:17,544
What colour is Robin's tummy?

8
00:00:19,544 --> 00:00:21,985
Red! That's one bird.

9
00:00:24,835 --> 00:00:25,966
Another bird!

10
00:00:25,966 --> 00:00:27,450
What colour is it?

11
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:31,016
Blue! One, two.

12
00:00:31,016 --> 00:00:32,147
Two birds!

13
00:00:34,997 --> 00:00:35,989
And this one?

14
00:00:35,989 --> 00:00:36,920
What colour?

15
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,262
Pink! One, two, three!

16
00:00:44,112 --> 00:00:44,971
One more!

17
00:00:44,971 --> 00:00:46,689
Yellow, like the sun.

18
00:00:46,939 --> 00:00:49,170
Now count them all with me!

19
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,074
How many birds?

20
00:00:53,074 --> 00:00:55,093
One, two, three, four!

21
00:00:55,093 --> 00:00:56,223
Four birds!

22
00:00:58,073 --> 00:00:59,328
Peck, peck, peck!

23
00:00:59,328 --> 00:01:00,958
Breakfast for everyone!

24
00:01:01,358 --> 00:01:03,063
Share with a friend and

25
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:05,226
subscribe to Honey Bunny Kidz!

26
00:01:05,726 --> 00:01:07,332
Watch the full story

27
00:01:07,332 --> 00:01:08,937
on Honey Bunny Kidz!
